          "body": "Wearables that remember the dark. Prints pulled straight off the walls of rooms you have already walked. Objects with no listed function — celestial beings rarely need one. Stock arrives the way mushrooms do: several at once, then nothing for a season. Checkout happens here. You never leave the dark to pay.",
